# Changelog

`CHANGELOG.md` is for **package consumers** (npm API, locale keys, session behavior). Follow [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/).

## Include

- Public API: `current()` shape, session methods, options, prayer/mystery keys
- Defaults and prayer order a consumer can observe
- Locale text or language additions

Unreleased work since the last published version goes under `[Unreleased]`. The version commit retitles that section to `[X.Y.Z] - YYYY-MM-DD`.

## Do not include

- CI, GitHub Actions, publish workflow, repo tooling, Cursor rules
- Internal refactors with the same public behavior
